<title>PORTUGAL: PRESS DIGEST - Portugal -- Jan 20.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Portugal -- Jan 20.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are leading domestic stories in Portuguese newspapers.</p>
<p>PUBLICO</p>
<p>- The government is preparing a package to fight unemployment to be implemented in the first quarter, a government source said.</p>
<p>DIARIO DE NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- Portugal and Spain are preparing a joint plan to fight smuggling.</p>
<p>- Cimpor, which already owns Corporacion Noroeste in Spain, seeks to acquire another cement manufacturer in Spain, sources in the sector said.</p>
<p>DIARIO ECONOMICO</p>
<p>- Antonio Champalimaud told the paper he may merge his banks into one unit.</p>
<p>- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
